    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awaken to the Unknown</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890200/extras/8f468c5f3de2dd8d53724a25d689800f.poster.avif?t=1719198551\" width=600 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890200/extras/8f468c5f3de2dd8d53724a25d689800f.webm?t=1719198551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890200/extras/8f468c5f3de2dd8d53724a25d689800f.mp4?t=1719198551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the dim light of an unfamiliar room, Eva finds herself trapped, her memories slipping through her grasp like shadows in the night. As her only guiding light, you must lead her through the labyrinthine corridors of her mind. Unravel the enigmatic puzzles, confront the demons that haunt her, and brave the unknown depths of edxn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890200/extras/edef412121b868d84935ab51a258738c.poster.avif?t=1719198551\" width=600 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890200/extras/edef412121b868d84935ab51a258738c.webm?t=1719198551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890200/extras/edef412121b868d84935ab51a258738c.mp4?t=1719198551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to a world where every corner holds a secret, where every step forward brings you closer to the truth. Explore eerie landscapes, gather fragments of forgotten memories, and navigate the delicate balance between sanity and despair.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890200/extras/0de85d2c2a1b519174a0b56f249f997d.avif?t=1719198551\" width=600 height=106 /></span><br>- Engage in mind-bending puzzles that challenge perception and logic.<br>- Confront inner demons in visceral combat encounters.<br>- Explore the hauntingly beautiful landscapes of edxn and uncover hidden treasures.<br>- Navigate treacherous paths where every decision could lead to revelation or ruin.",
